    "extraction": "Original table code inner HTML. Remove HTML-source CR/LF layout, translate each <br/> to LF and each &nbsp; to ASCII space, then HTML-decode once. No XML parsing, trimming, indentation changes, DTD removal or encoding-declaration changes. All seven displayed inputs contain only ASCII characters, including the input declaring ISO-8859-1. Base64 stores the resulting complete XML input octets. Section 3.2 also retains the adjacent literal HTML comments as independent whitespace evidence."
